      "the separate tagline line is gone because its text is now part of the main title (the string is still present, inside the title)",
      "palette, type scale, chip, card style and font families unchanged"
    ],
    "round-03": [
      "page background: #0A0F24->#141034 gradient replaced by #FBFAFF->#EDE9FB",
      "info panel: translucent #FFFFFF0F on dark replaced by solid #FFFFFF with a violet hairline border #6D4AFF33, so the card now needs its own edge",
      "brand plates: dark-theme alphas (#3A1FB0B3 / #6D4AFF8C) replaced by opaque light violets (#D7CCFF / #B7A2FF) with stronger borders, because a 70% alpha plate over a light page would wash out",
      "light beam: #4BE3C8F2 (mint, meant for a dark page) replaced by #0E9E86E6 so it still reads as light on white",
      "spark: white dot kept (it sits on the violet top plate), ring changed from mint to #0E9E86",
      "chip: #6D4AFF -> #5B2BE0 and the pill stays white-on-violet",
      "accents: tick/accent ink #7FE9D6 -> #5326E8, muted ink #B7BEE0 -> #4B4478, body ink #F5F4FF -> #1B1440",
      "aura glow: #6D4AFF59 (additive-looking on dark) -> #6D4AFF33 radial",
      "header rules and panel dividers: #FFFFFF26 -> #6D4AFF3D"
    ]
